          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilyo mulelukusha imiolifa yenu umuku wakubalilapo mwikalabwelela ku misambo ukuyalukusha umuku wabubili no tusheleko. Utusheleko twena mukalelekela abenafyalo, bakashiwa na bamukamfwilwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.24.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.24.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 24:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilyo mwapwisha ukusaba ifitwalo fya myangashi mwibala lyenu, mwikalabwelelako no kuya saba utusheleko. Utusheleko twena mukalelekela abenafyalo, bakashiwa na bamukamfwilwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.24.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.24.21"
            ]
          }
        },
